THE DATA this package reads — CC-BY 4.0
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The vehicle dataset is NOT covered by the MIT licence above. It is published
under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Free for any use, including commercial. Visible credit with a link is a
CONDITION of that licence (§3(a)), not a courtesy. The form requested:

    Vehicle data by VehiclesDB (https://vehiclesdb.com)

`VehiclesDB(...).attribution` returns that notice at runtime, and
`.attribution_html` returns the ready-to-embed link, so you never have to
copy the prose by hand.

Upstream register notices (KBA's dl-de/by-2-0, RDW's terms, Traficom's CC-BY,
and the rest) apply under EVERY licence for this data, the commercial one
included — they are the registers' own terms, not VehiclesDB's to waive:

    https://github.com/vehiclesdb/vehiclesdb/blob/main/ATTRIBUTION.md
